title: What the fork itself recorded, its hides among them, goes with it; a filing the reply made in a subscriber of the user's stays.
pid: 3c482504-eac9-43d1-a786-aacdb314893a
body: |2-
  So the message is drawn with all its children again. Where the reply
  had filed the message in Jeff's fork of the note, deleting the fork
  there is a deletion under his own note, which takes the message out
  and hides it (the choice above). No other way seemed worth having.
